  "description": "Go big and bold with Western Saturday, a powerful display font that reimagines classic frontier typography for the modern creator. Featuring tall, condensed letterforms and iconic spurred serifs, this typeface commands attention with its massive presence and rugged silhouette. Its heavy slab-serif construction makes it the perfect choice for high-impact headlines, vintage-style signage, outlaw-themed branding, and bold poster designs.\nWhether you’re building a brand for a smokehouse, a barbershop, or a heritage apparel line, Western Saturday brings a sense of grit, tradition, and uncompromising strength to your layout.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Go big and bold with Western Saturday, a powerful display font that reimagines classic frontier typography for the modern creator. Featuring tall, condensed letterforms and iconic spurred serifs, this typeface commands attention with its massive presence and rugged silhouette. Its heavy slab-serif construction makes it the perfect choice for high-impact headlines, vintage-style signage, outlaw-themed branding, and bold poster designs.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re building a brand for a smokehouse, a barbershop, or a heritage apparel line, Western Saturday brings a sense of grit, tradition, and uncompromising strength to your layout.</p>",
